  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Danish Support for the Implementation of the Kunming-Montreal Global Biodiversity Framework 2023-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to benefit developing countries and IPLCs through a set of activities that support the achievement of the GBF goals and targets, including capacity-building and learning activities for enhanced implementation of the GBF-2020, notably through provision of guidance on the revision of the national biodiversity strategies and action plans (NBSAPs) and support tools for implementation. In that context, the project will provide support to address the capacity development priorities of developing countries aimed to enhance integrated implementation of the Convention and its Protocols on biosafety, and access and benefit sharing.</narrative>
  </description>
